OL,3,GNEWSAMan found dead inside burning
OL,4,Abungalow
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn elderly man has died in a bungalow
OL,7,Ffire in Heanor.
OL,9,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,10,Fcrews were sent to the blaze at the
OL,11,Fdetached bungalow in Banksburn Close at
OL,12,Fabout 07:30 GMT on Wednesday, following
OL,13,Fa 999 call from a carer.
OL,15,FFour firefighters entered the property
OL,16,Fand found the man, believed to be in
OL,17,Fhis 80s, was already dead. No-one else
OL,18,Fwas at the address.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
